    "INDEX-1<SEP>Pretend to be a character in a post-apocalyptic world. Describe how you survive and the allies you encounter.<SEP>I am a brilliant engineer named Tom. I have scavenged and built an amazing underground bunker with solar panels and wind turbines. I have also built a robotic companion, Rosie, who helps me. I survive by growing my own food in hydroponic gardens. I also gather water from a nearby lake. I have encountered many other survivors along the way. One of them is a former doctor named Sarah, who helps me treat my injuries. Another one is a skilled hunter named Mark, who helps me find food. Together, we form a strong alliance and survive the post-apocalyptic world.": -2.28125,
